<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472" title="View the profile of Kriyn">Kriyn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 71<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/jonny/jonny54.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m not living, I&#039;m just killing time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" title="Magelo - Kriyn Nutzforcatnip" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6600#msg6600"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6600#msg6600">Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> April 01, 2004, 10:32:11 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hey, I&#039;ve been working on my master key for Howling Stone and have run into a problem. &nbsp;So far I&#039;ve collected the drop&#039;d key parts for the master key in both the North and West wings but have not found the one in the South wing yet. &nbsp;Also some of the doors in the South wing are locked and have not come across any keys that drop from the mobs. &nbsp;If anyone that has finished their key could help me out it would be greatly appreciated. &nbsp;I&#039;ve been able to clear up to the South wing boss but had to gate after repops collected on me. &nbsp;Does the South wing boss drop the key that unlocks most of the doors in the South? &nbsp;
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />I&#039;m ok, how are you?<br /><img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/radiohead/radiohead13.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" target="_blank">Kriyn Nutzforcatnip</a><br />70 Prophet of Radiohead<br />Reign of Swords
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg6606"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
