								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6606#msg6606">Re:Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> April 02, 2004, 08:17:50 am &#187;</span></td>
