				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg6610"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285" title="View the profile of Serepi">Serepi</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 66<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://cfusionpm.com/misc/pulltoopen.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								It&#039;s all about the tail, baby!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6610#msg6610"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6610#msg6610">Re:Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> April 02, 2004, 10:22:54 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It does in fact work, and the new key, &quot;Hand of Glory&quot; will be added to your keyring. &nbsp;I&#039;m kind of a keyring freak, so I did the quest right when it came out.<br /><br />The information you probably found on the South Key wing piece is outdated. &nbsp;At least it was on the sites that I researched it on. &nbsp;The South Wing key piece is a ground spawn, it does not drop from any mob in the south wing. &nbsp;All the other wings are ground spawns as well. &nbsp;The respawn timer is slightly longer (IIRC) than mob respawn time.<br /><br />Anyway to answer your question more specifically, the south key wing piece is behind a locked door that&#039;s a little northeast of the room where the boss mob spawns, the 8th iksar shaman cudgel fight room. &nbsp;To get access to the room, you have to get a key called the Coin Depicting Innoruuk.<br /><br />You get the coin by entering the south hall, go thru the VS picture, then follow hall to the right. &nbsp;At first left, go left and clear this dais room. &nbsp;Move south to the wall. &nbsp;Take a right, hug this wall on your left. &nbsp;(There is a pit trap on top in center of dais.) &nbsp;Exit the door. &nbsp;Clear 1 roamer. &nbsp;The door in front of you is where the key is. &nbsp;The key is also a ground spawn. &nbsp;Clear this room. &nbsp;4ish or so mobs will come simultaneously. &nbsp;But it&#039;s kunark, so no worries, they don&#039;t hit hard. &nbsp;You&#039;ll see a bag on the floor in the back center of the room. &nbsp;Pick this up. &nbsp;It&#039;s the Coin Depciting Innoruuk.<br /><br />Back out of that room and go back to the dais room. &nbsp;Go straight east, hugging wall on your right. &nbsp;At T intersection shortly past room, take a right. &nbsp;Go past fake wall, which is the secret hall to 8th cudgel fight room. &nbsp;Go to the next right, use key, open door.<br /><br />Clear the mobs here, and there, on the ground, should be the part of the Hand of Glory you need.<br /><br />I can confirm this quest does work, is not bugged, and is kind of fun. &nbsp;Congratulations on adding the Hand of Glory to your keyring. &nbsp;If you have any questions, post again or /tell me in game. &nbsp;HS is one of my favorite zones; many fond memories there. &nbsp;<br /><br />Good luck. &nbsp;I remain,<br /><br />At your service.<br /><br />EDIT: &nbsp;Here&#039;s a map/guide for your review. &nbsp;The guide is outdated, but the map is current.<br /><br /><a href="http://cloud.prohosting.com/~talone/Charasis.htm#Keys" target="_blank">http://cloud.prohosting.com/~talone/Charasis.htm#Keys</a><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
