	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg6615"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472" title="View the profile of Kriyn">Kriyn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 71<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/jonny/jonny54.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m not living, I&#039;m just killing time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" title="Magelo - Kriyn Nutzforcatnip" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6615#msg6615"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6615#msg6615">Re:Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> April 02, 2004, 01:07:34 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thanks a lot for your post Seripi. &nbsp;Aye, I&#039;ve been using that site&#039;s map for help but when I reached the room with the ground spawn key to unlock the doors in the South it wasn&#039;t there. &nbsp;I prob just missed it after clearing the mobs and will try again later today. &nbsp;<br /> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br /> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;I cleared all the rooms but the locked ones in South but had an undead Undertaker spawn in the secret hallway and brought some friends with him so I had to gate. &nbsp;I regret not coming here earlier on, seems like a grt place to come and get xp. &nbsp;The aa xp isn&#039;t too bad once your in the south wing. &nbsp;<br /><br /> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Another thing, would I, a lvl 65 shm, be able to solo Dru in the East wing? &nbsp;From what I&#039;ve read the last hand piece is in the room where she is. &nbsp;So far I haven&#039;t had any problems with any of the named mobs here while keeping my pet buffed and Quiescence on both of us. &nbsp;I can handle up to 4 mobs on me, but usually only have to deal with 2 at the most. &nbsp;This quest is really fun, but only prob is the clearing around the wings which can take a while solo&#039;ing. &nbsp;<br /><br /> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; I&#039;m guessing that the East wing doesn&#039;t have any locked doors when looking at the map. &nbsp;This would eliminate having to look for a key. &nbsp;Any tips on moving around East wing as I have not ventured that far?
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: April 02, 2004, 01:14:12 pm by Kriyn</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />I&#039;m ok, how are you?<br /><img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/radiohead/radiohead13.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" target="_blank">Kriyn Nutzforcatnip</a><br />70 Prophet of Radiohead<br />Reign of Swords
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
