		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg6622"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285" title="View the profile of Serepi">Serepi</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 66<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://cfusionpm.com/misc/pulltoopen.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								It&#039;s all about the tail, baby!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=285"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6622#msg6622"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6622#msg6622">Re:Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> April 02, 2004, 03:19:04 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Happy to help.<br /><br />Hm, I&#039;m curious why you didn&#039;t find the Coin in the room where it&#039;s marked on the map. &nbsp;Possibly someone else had looted? &nbsp;Confirm that you were in the right room, the map shows it as the room with that green X that&#039;s NW of the south boss mob room. &nbsp;Good luck on south.<br /><br />I&#039;m a shaman as well, and I think with a little skill you could solo it. &nbsp;I took a SK friend down with me, and duoing it was well within our capabilities. &nbsp;The only thing about Dru&#039;s room is that she has 4 guards, that, without paci, will come all at once. &nbsp; &nbsp;My suggestion (if you have the AA) is that VP3 on one, click root another, back off, dogdog can tank one, get his slowed, and then you Bane, BoS, and VS through the last, reroot as needed. &nbsp;I think you should be able to do it. &nbsp;A lot easier if you can get a duo partner: necro, mage, rogue, pally, SK almost anything would be great.<br /><br />You are correct, you can get to Dru&#039;s room without any keys, as long as you lev over from north platform to east platform. &nbsp;<br /><br />As far as to moving around in east, again, there&#039;s a pull of the room right before you get to the final hall before Dru&#039;s room, that has an upper &quot;mezzanine&quot; type of walkway around it. &nbsp;Mobs will social aggro from up there, so you&#039;ll be 3/4 through a fight and get 3 adds or something. &nbsp;Just be very very careful pulling that room if you&#039;re solo. &nbsp;SC &amp; VP will help a ton with CC.<br /><br />Hope that helps. &nbsp;(Beware of my advice though, according to some, I am akin to the devil and pure evil at heart!)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Serepi Serein<br />Officer, Hegemony Guild<br />&quot;Delenda est Carthago&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
