								<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" title="Magelo - Kriyn Nutzforcatnip" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6670#msg6670"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6670#msg6670">Re:Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> April 05, 2004, 04:51:30 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I got my South piece, but probably going to need a partner to clear out East wing. &nbsp;Made my way into East but had repops close behind and was having probs with pulling singles. &nbsp;Going to try and finish it this week.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />I&#039;m ok, how are you?<br /><img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/radiohead/radiohead13.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" target="_blank">Kriyn Nutzforcatnip</a><br />70 Prophet of Radiohead<br />Reign of Swords
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg6673"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
