								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=746.msg6673#msg6673">Re:Howling Stone Master Key</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> April 05, 2004, 05:11:42 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							When you head down, zip me a /tell. &nbsp;If I&#039;m free, be glad to head down there with you. &nbsp;I get nostalgic yearnings for HS every now and then. &nbsp;Let me know.
						</td>
					</tr>
